    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d729">

                <pb facs="0700" n="688" sameAs="frus:frus1943v04/pg688"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.1561/25: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Liberia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Walton</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Monrovia</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-12-04T15:00:00-00:44">December 4, 1943—3
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received December 6—5:20 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>202. Cabinet Friday favorably considered port project. Agreement is likely to be
                    concluded and signed week of December 13.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Walton</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
